main is operation
main purpose "Build (1 + 2) + x, define x and y, print the tree's value, then print each defined name"
main invariant none
main typeParameter none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwnedBy none
main raises none
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memoryHeap true
main async false
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label printValue loopKind none
main label printValue within none
main label listNames loopKind forEach
main label listNames within none
main label listNames maxIterations nameCount
main label listNames over symbolTable
